<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35472" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">persĕcūtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				following after</i>, <i>a chasing</i>, <i>pursuing; a chase</i>, <i>pursuit.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bestiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					41, 1, 44</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">ib. 41, 1, 4</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">App. M. 4, p. 155, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pluviis persecutionem passi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Sap. 16, 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 21</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A prosecution</i>, <i>action</i>, <i>suit</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Or. 41, 141</span></i> (dub.; al.
			praescriptionum); <i><span class="en">Dig. 46, 4, 18, §
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A persecution</i>, esp. of Christians,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Spect. 27</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">De Fuga in Persecutione,</span>”
				<i>the title of a treatise by Tertullian</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Matt. 5, 10</span></i>
			 et saep.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>A following up</i>, <i>prosecution</i> of an affair: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">negotii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 10, p. 252, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
